# Purpose: Cache a selected CSV field for a stable lookup list.
# Inputs: selected-field.txt (one numeric column index without a newline) and requests.csv (unquoted CSV with request_id, region, and status columns).
# Outputs: Sorted distinct values from the selected field; changing the selector stores a result for the new column.
accept selected_field_path as text with default "selected-field.txt"
accept requests_path as text with default "requests.csv"
read file selected_field_path as selected
run cat with path requests_path
then cut with delimiter "," and fields selected and cache
then tail with flags ["-n", "+2"]
then sort
then uniq
